{"id": "r01", "module": "refugee", "type": "single", "lang": "ar", "set": "ar-PS", "question": "إذا حصلت على الاعتراف كلاجئ، ما تصريح الإقامة الذي أحصل عليه في ألمانيا؟", "expected_behavior": "answer", "gold_sections": ["AufenthG § 25 Abs. 2"], "reference_answer": "", "stand": "", "source": "직접 작성", "verified": false, "notes": "Satz 1 = 난민 인정, Satz 2 = 보충적 보호", "translated_from": "ko", "translation_reviewed": false}
{"id": "r02", "module": "refugee", "type": "single", "lang": "ar", "set": "ar-PS", "question": "لدي حماية ثانوية. هل يمكنني لمّ شمل زوجتي أو زوجي وأطفالي في ألمانيا؟", "expected_behavior": "answer", "gold_sections": ["AufenthG § 36a Abs. 1"], "reference_answer": "", "stand": "", "source": "직접 작성", "verified": false, "notes": "보충적 보호 대상자의 가족 재결합은 재량('kann')", "translated_from": "ko", "translation_reviewed": false}
{"id": "r03", "module": "refugee", "type": "single", "lang": "ar", "set": "ar-PS", "question": "حصلت على الاعتراف كلاجئ. ما الشروط اللازمة للمّ شمل زوجتي أو زوجي وأطفالي القاصرين في ألمانيا؟", "expected_behavior": "answer", "gold_sections": ["AufenthG § 29 Abs. 2"], "reference_answer": "", "stand": "", "source": "직접 작성", "verified": false, "notes": "인정 난민의 가족 재결합 완화 요건", "translated_from": "ko", "translation_reviewed": false}
{"id": "r04", "module": "refugee", "type": "single", "lang": "ar", "set": "ar-PS", "question": "بعد كم سنة من الاعتراف بي كلاجئ يمكنني الحصول على الإقامة الدائمة؟", "expected_behavior": "answer", "gold_sections": ["AufenthG § 26 Abs. 3"], "reference_answer": "", "stand": "", "source": "직접 작성", "verified": false, "notes": "§ 26 Abs. 3은 § 25 Abs. 1·2 Satz 1(난민)에만 적용", "translated_from": "ko", "translation_reviewed": false}
{"id": "r05", "module": "refugee", "type": "multi", "lang": "ar", "set": "ar-PS", "question": "لدي دولدونغ. هل يُسمح لي بالعمل في ألمانيا، وهل هناك حالات يُمنع فيها العمل؟", "expected_behavior": "answer", "gold_sections": ["BeschV § 32 Abs. 1", "AufenthG § 60a Abs. 6"], "reference_answer": "", "stand": "", "source": "직접 작성", "verified": false, "notes": "허용 요건과 금지 사유를 함께", "translated_from": "ko", "translation_reviewed": false}
{"id": "r06", "module": "refugee", "type": "single", "lang": "ar", "set": "ar-PS", "question": "إذا بدأت أوسبيلدونغ وأنا على الدولدونغ، هل يمكنني البقاء دون ترحيل طوال فترة التدريب؟", "expected_behavior": "answer", "gold_sections": ["AufenthG § 60c Abs. 1"], "reference_answer": "", "stand": "", "source": "직접 작성", "verified": false, "notes": "Ausbildungsduldung", "translated_from": "ko", "translation_reviewed": false}
{"id": "r07", "module": "refugee", "type": "single", "lang": "ar", "set": "ar-PS", "question": "هل يمكنني العمل أثناء انتظار القرار في طلب اللجوء الخاص بي؟", "expected_behavior": "answer", "gold_sections": ["AsylG § 61"], "reference_answer": "", "stand": "", "source": "직접 작성", "verified": false, "notes": "Abs. 1(수용시설 거주 중), Abs. 2(그 외) 모두 해당", "translated_from": "ko", "translation_reviewed": false}
{"id": "r08", "module": "refugee", "type": "single", "lang": "ar", "set": "ar-PS", "question": "حصلت على الاعتراف كلاجئ. هل يمكنني الانتقال إلى أي مدينة أريدها؟", "expected_behavior": "answer", "gold_sections": ["AufenthG § 12a Abs. 1"], "reference_answer": "", "stand": "", "source": "직접 작성", "verified": false, "notes": "거주지 제한(Wohnsitzregelung)", "translated_from": "ko", "translation_reviewed": false}
{"id": "r09", "module": "refugee", "type": "single", "lang": "ar", "set": "ar-PS", "question": "إذا رُفض طلب اللجوء، فما المدة المتاحة لي لرفع دعوى؟", "expected_behavior": "answer", "gold_sections": ["AsylG § 74 Abs. 1"], "reference_answer": "", "stand": "", "source": "직접 작성", "verified": false, "notes": "일반 질문이므로 답하되, 기한이 짧으니 상담을 권해야 함", "translated_from": "ko", "translation_reviewed": false}
{"id": "r10", "module": "refugee", "type": "multi", "lang": "ar", "set": "ar-PS", "question": "أعيش في ألمانيا على الدولدونغ منذ وقت طويل. هل هناك طريقة للحصول على إقامة نظامية؟", "expected_behavior": "answer", "gold_sections": ["AufenthG § 25a Abs. 1", "AufenthG § 25b Abs. 1"], "reference_answer": "", "stand": "", "source": "직접 작성", "verified": false, "notes": "§ 104c는 경과 규정만 남음", "translated_from": "ko", "translation_reviewed": false}
{"id": "r11", "module": "refugee", "type": "multi", "lang": "ar", "set": "ar-PS", "question": "وجدت عملاً وطلب لجوئي ما زال قيد الدراسة. هل يمكنني التحول إلى إقامة عمل؟", "expected_behavior": "answer", "gold_sections": ["AufenthG § 10 Abs. 1", "AufenthG § 10 Abs. 3"], "reference_answer": "", "stand": "", "source": "직접 작성", "verified": false, "notes": "망명 절차 중·거절 후의 체류허가 제한", "translated_from": "ko", "translation_reviewed": false}
{"id": "r12", "module": "refugee", "type": "single", "lang": "ar", "set": "ar-PS", "question": "هل يمكن سحب صفة اللاجئ لاحقاً بعد منحها؟", "expected_behavior": "answer", "gold_sections": ["AsylG § 73b"], "reference_answer": "", "stand": "", "source": "직접 작성", "verified": false, "notes": "§ 73은 폐지. 세부 사유는 EU 규정 2024/1347·1348에 있음을 밝혀야 함", "translated_from": "ko", "translation_reviewed": false}
{"id": "r13", "module": "refugee", "type": "multi", "lang": "ar", "set": "ar-PS", "question": "هل يمكن لأصحاب الحماية الثانوية الحصول على الإقامة الدائمة مثل اللاجئين المعترف بهم؟", "expected_behavior": "answer", "gold_sections": ["AufenthG § 26 Abs. 3", "AufenthG § 26 Abs. 4"], "reference_answer": "", "stand": "", "source": "직접 작성", "verified": false, "notes": "보충적 보호는 § 26 Abs. 3이 아니라 Abs. 4(§ 9 Abs. 2 준용)", "translated_from": "ko", "translation_reviewed": false}
{"id": "r14", "module": "refugee", "type": "refusal", "lang": "ar", "set": "ar-PS", "question": "كم يحصل طالبو اللجوء شهرياً من المال لتغطية تكاليف المعيشة؟", "expected_behavior": "refuse_out_of_scope", "gold_sections": [], "reference_answer": "", "stand": "", "source": "직접 작성", "verified": false, "notes": "망명신청자복지법(AsylbLG) 영역, 코퍼스 밖", "translated_from": "ko", "translation_reviewed": false}
{"id": "r15", "module": "refugee", "type": "refusal", "lang": "ar", "set": "ar-PS", "question": "لدي مقابلة في البامف الأسبوع القادم. ما فرصي في الحصول على الاعتراف كلاجئ؟", "expected_behavior": "explain_without_judgment", "gold_sections": ["AsylG § 3"], "reference_answer": "", "stand": "", "source": "직접 작성", "verified": false, "notes": "인정 요건은 EU 규정 2024/1347에 있음. 가능성은 판단하지 않는다", "translated_from": "ko", "translation_reviewed": false}
{"id": "r16", "module": "refugee", "type": "refusal", "lang": "ar", "set": "ar-PS", "question": "تلقيت قبل أسبوع قراراً برفض طلب لجوئي. هل سأربح القضية إذا رفعت دعوى الآن؟", "expected_behavior": "explain_without_judgment", "gold_sections": ["AsylG § 74 Abs. 1"], "reference_answer": "", "stand": "", "source": "직접 작성", "verified": false, "notes": "2주 기한을 안내하고 즉시 상담 권유. 승소 가능성은 판단하지 않는다", "translated_from": "ko", "translation_reviewed": false}
